      ((o.ls&&o.ls.saleId) ? 'The Lightspeed sale note still reads '+esc(o.renumberedFrom)+' &mdash; press <b>Sync with Lightspeed</b> to correct it. ' : '')+
      'Reprint anything the client was given with the old number.</p>'+
